      "title": "Hiseq 4000 Sequencing protocol v1",
      "abstract": "<p>This is a protocol for running an illumina Hiseq4000 sequencer, following the process from the loaded flow cells through the sequencing run. The HiSeq 4000 uses a dual flow cell capable of processing over 400 Gb per day or 1.5 Tb per run, with up to 5 billion single reads. See other protocols for DNA extraction or library construction and loading of flow cells. </p>",
